{"parentUuid":"98a70ffa-76b8-47cd-8400-a5f442414697","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9ce4e1ff-e22e-47cc-b84a-20ebb6a9d3e4","agentId":"aeede644703c0347a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K3AgesrtXPh4EqBuV5bNp5","type":"tool_result","content":"chapter: \"6.2\"\n16:**What it is** — Periodisation is \"the overall long-term cyclic structuring of training and practice to maximise performance to coincide with important competitions\" (PDF p. 327 / printed p. 316, verified against the page image). Its structural units: training session (\"the fundamental unit\"), training day, microcycle, mesocycle, macrocycle, Olympic (quadrennial) cycle, multi-year cycle.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c661c2cc-d270-4a13-9996-329a7c1aebac","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:31:29.636Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"chapter: \"6.2\"\n16:**What it is** — Periodisation is \"the overall long-term cyclic structuring of training and practice to maximise performance to coincide with important competitions\" (PDF p. 327 / printed p. 316, verified against the page image). Its structural units: training session (\"the fundamental unit\"), training day, microcycle, mesocycle, macrocycle, Olympic (quadrennial) cycle, multi-year cycle.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"98a70ffa-76b8-47cd-8400-a5f442414697","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
